:22.250">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.250" end="00:25.940"><span begin="00:22.250" end="00:22.760">Ooo </span><span begin="00:22.760" end="00:23.270">baby</span><span begin="00:23.270" end="00:23.310">.</span><span begin="00:23.310" end="00:23.350">.</span><span begin="00:23.350" end="00:23.390">. </span><span begin="00:23.390" end="00:24.020">ooo</span><span begin="00:24.020" end="00:24.030">.</span><span begin="00:24.030" end="00:24.040">.</span><span begin="00:24.040" end="00:24.050">. </span><span begin="00:24.050" end="00:24.500">said </span><span begin="00:24.500" end="00:25.940">ooo</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.000" end="00:28.190"><span begin="00:26.000" end="00:26.330">And </span><span begin="00:26.330" end="00:26.510">the </span><span begin="00:26.510" end="00:27.020">days </span><span begin="00:27.020" end="00:27.350">go </span><span begin="00:27.350" end="00:28.160">by</span><span begin="00:28.160" end="00:28.170">.</span><span begin="00:28.170" end="00:28.180">.</span><span begin="00:28.180" end="00:28.190">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.190" end="00:30.380"><span begin="00:28.190" end="00:28.550">Like </span><span begin="00:28.550" end="00:28.580">a </span><span begin="00:28.580" end="00:29.300">strand </span><span begin="00:29.300" end="00:29.630">in </span><span begin="00:29.630" end="00:29.690">the </span><span begin="00:29.690" end="00:30.350">wind</span><span begin="00:30.350" end="00:30.360">.</span><span begin="00:30.360" end="00:30.370">.</span><span begin="00:30.370" end="00:30.380">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.380" end="00:32.570"><span begin="00:30.380" end="00:30.710">In </span><span begin="00:30.710" end="00:30.770">the </span><span begin="00:30.770" end="00:31.190">web </span><span begin="00:31.190" end="00:31.580">that </span><span begin="00:31.580" end="00:31.790">is </span><span begin="00:31.790" end="00:32.030">my </span><span begin="00:32.030" end="00:32.540">own</span><span begin="00:32.540" end="00:32.550">.</span><span begin="00:32.550" end="00:32.560">.</span><span begin="00:32.560" end="00:32.570">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.570" end="00:34.820"><span begin="00:32.570" end="00:32.870">I </span><span begin="00:32.870" end="00:33.500">begin </span><span begin="00:33.500" end="00:34.820">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.120" end="00:38.360"><span begin="00:35.120" end="00:35.570">Said </span><span begin="00:35.570" end="00:35.690">to </span><span begin="00:35.690" end="00:36.020">my </span><span begin="00:36.020" end="00:36.800">friend</span><span begin="00:36.800" end="00:36.800">, </span><span begin="00:36.800" end="00:38.150">baby</span><span begin="00:38.150" end="00:38.220">.</span><span begin="00:38.220" end="00:38.290">.</span><span begin="00:38.290" end="00:38.360">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.360" end="00:40.730"><span begin="00:38.360" end="00:38.990">Nothin' </span><span begin="00:38.990" end="00:39.320">else </span><span begin="00:39.320" end="00:40.730">mattered</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.820" end="00:50.840"><span begin="00:43.820" end="00:44.180">He </span><span begin="00:44.180" end="00:44.330">was </span><span begin="00:44.330" end="00:44.660">no </span><span begin="00:44.660" end="00:47.390">more</span><span begin="00:47.390" end="00:47.390">.</span><span begin="00:47.390" end="00:47.390">.</span><span begin="00:47.390" end="00:47.390">. </span><span begin="00:47.390" end="00:47.780">than </span><span begin="00:47.780" end="00:47.960">a </span><span begin="00:47.960" end="00:49.010">baby </span><span begin="00:49.010" end="00:50.840">then</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.830" end="00:55.580"><span begin="00:51.830" end="00:52.190">Well </span><span begin="00:52.190" end="00:52.700">he</span><span begin="00:52.700" end="00:52.700">.</span><span begin="00:52.700" end="00:52.700">.</span><span begin="00:52.700" end="00:52.700">. </span><span begin="00:52.700" end="00:53.090">seemed </span><span begin="00:53.090" end="00:53.630">broken </span><span begin="00:53.630" end="00:55.370">hearted</span><span begin="00:55.370" end="00:55.440">.</span><span begin="00:55.440" end="00:55.510">.</span><span begin="00:55.510" end="00:55.580">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.580" end="00:57.500"><span begin="00:55.580" end="00:56.300">Something </span><span begin="00:56.300" end="00:57.170">within </span><span begin="00:57.170" end="00:57.500">him</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.620" end="01:05.360"><span begin="01:00.620" end="01:00.800">But </span><span begin="01:00.800" end="01:01.010">the </span><span begin="01:01.010" end="01:02.330">moment</span><span begin="01:02.330" end="01:02.460">.</span><span begin="01:02.460" end="01:02.590">.</span><span begin="01:02.590" end="01:02.720">. </span><span begin="01:02.720" end="01:02.990">that </span><span begin="01:02.990" end="01:03.170">I </span><span begin="01:03.170" end="01:03.590">first </span><span begin="01:03.590" end="01:04.550">laid</span><span begin="01:04.550" end="01:04.820">.</span><span begin="01:04.820" end="01:05.090">.</span><span begin="01:05.090" end="01:05.360">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.360" end="01:09.590"><span begin="01:05.360" end="01:06.440">Eyes</span><span begin="01:06.440" end="01:06.460">.</span><span begin="01:06.460" end="01:06.480">.</span><span begin="01:06.480" end="01:06.500">. </span><span begin="01:06.500" end="01:07.520">on</span><span begin="01:07.520" end="01:07.530">.</span><span begin="01:07.530" end="01:07.540">.</span><span begin="01:07.540" end="01:07.550">. </span><span begin="01:07.550" end="01:08.510">him</span><span begin="01:08.510" end="01:08.510">.</span><span begin="01:08.510" end="01:08.510">.</span><span begin="01:08.510" end="01:08.510">. </span><span begin="01:08.510" end="01:08.780">all </span><span begin="01:08.780" end="01:09.590">alone</span><span begin="01:09.590" end="01:09.590">.</span><span b