" end="01:23.860">.</span><span begin="01:23.860" end="01:23.900">. </span><span begin="01:23.900" end="01:24.530">ooo</span><span begin="01:24.530" end="01:24.540">.</span><span begin="01:24.540" end="01:24.550">.</span><span begin="01:24.550" end="01:24.560">. </span><span begin="01:24.560" end="01:24.950">said </span><span begin="01:24.950" end="01:25.910">ooo</span><span begin="01:25.910" end="01:25.920">.</span><span begin="01:25.920" end="01:25.930">.</span><span begin="01:25.930" end="01:25.940">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.940" end="01:28.610"><span begin="01:25.940" end="01:26.330">Just </span><span begin="01:26.330" end="01:26.570">like </span><span begin="01:26.570" end="01:26.750">the </span><span begin="01:26.750" end="01:27.290">white </span><span begin="01:27.290" end="01:27.890">winged </span><span begin="01:27.890" end="01:28.610">dove</span><span begin="01:28.610" end="01:28.610">.</span><span begin="01:28.610" end="01:28.610">.</span><span begin="01:28.610" end="01:28.610">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.610" end="01:31.460"><span begin="01:28.610" end="01:29.030">Sings </span><span begin="01:29.030" end="01:29.060">a </span><span begin="01:29.060" end="01:29.480">song</span><span begin="01:29.480" end="01:29.480">.</span><span begin="01:29.480" end="01:29.480">.</span><span begin="01:29.480" end="01:29.480">. </span><span begin="01:29.480" end="01:29.840">Sounds </span><span begin="01:29.840" end="01:30.050">like </span><span begin="01:30.050" end="01:30.290">she's </span><span begin="01:30.290" end="01:31.010">singing</span><span begin="01:31.010" end="01:31.160">.</span><span begin="01:31.160" end="01:31.310">.</span><span begin="01:31.310" end="01:31.460">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.460" end="01:35.270"><span begin="01:31.460" end="01:31.910">Ooo </span><span begin="01:31.910" end="01:32.450">baby</span><span begin="01:32.450" end="01:32.480">.</span><span begin="01:32.480" end="01:32.510">.</span><span 